      <rules>
        <rule name="Expert Weaponsmith" id="12b80f37-89dc-ffd8-3999-7b4649d94e9b" hidden="false" page="0">
          <description>a Dwarf Engineer can increase the distance the warband’s missile weapons can shoot. All Dwarf missile weapons in the warband have their range increased by 3&quot; for Pistols and 6&quot; for Crossbows and Handguns. Any range increases are only maintained as long as the Dwarf Engineer remains with the warband.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
